<title>UK: American Express sets $400 mln five-yr bond,+36 bp.</title>
<headline>American Express sets $400 mln five-yr bond,+36 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AMERICAN EXPRESS CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $400 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    12.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    12.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+36 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.3	 SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
